  "description": "Mal-Suk and Se-Ri are identical twins. Mal-Suk works two shifts at a factory to help pay for her younger sister Se-Ri's tuition. Se-Ri lives a life of college during the day and indulging in luxury at night while earning pocket money at a club. Then one day, Se=Ri becomes hopelessly entangled with Hui-Chul, Mal-Suk's boyfriend, whom she met at the club...",
